<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>DIMIGI ARAHAN</title>
    <!-- Font Awesome 6 -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter + Fira Code -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            color: #0f172a;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #e2e8f0;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #3b82f6;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 32px;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 80px 0 100px;
            border-bottom-left-radius: 32px;
            border-bottom-right-radius: 32px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .hero::after {
            content: "</>";
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 140px;
            opacity: 0.05;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -20px;
            right: 20px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, #94a3b8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }
        .hero .tagline {
            margin-top: 24px;
            background: rgba(59,130,246,0.2);
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 24px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
        }

        section {
            padding: 80px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
            text-align: center;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            color: #0f172a;
        }
        .section-title i {
            color: #3b82f6;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }
        .section-title:after, .section-title:before {
            content: '';
            width: 50px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #3b82f6;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .team-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 32px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
        .team-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 28px 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            border: 1px solid #eef2ff;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .team-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 35px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        .avatar {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background: #eef2ff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            color: #1e40af;
        }
        .team-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .team-card .role {
            color: #3b82f6;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .team-card .bio {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #334155;
        }

        .gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 28px;
        }
        .gallery-item {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
            transition: 0.2s;
            border: 1px solid #eef2ff;
        }
        .gallery-item:hover {
            transform: scale(1.01);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .gallery-img {
            height: 220px;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-color: #1e293b;
        }
        .gallery-caption {
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .gallery-caption h4 {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .gallery-caption p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .months-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 28px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .month-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 22px 20px;
            border-left: 5px solid #3b82f6;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            border: 1px solid #e9eef3;
            border-left-width: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .month-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 30px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }
        .month-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .month-name {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
        }
        .month-badge {
            background: #e0f2fe;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #0369a1;
        }
        .month-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin: 12px 0 8px;
            color: #1e293b;
        }
        .month-desc {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #334155;
            line-height: 1.45;
        }
        .tech-stack {
            margin-top: 14px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .tech-tag {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            color: #0f3b6f;
        }
        .click-hint {
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: #3b82f6;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 1000;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .modal-content {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 32px;
            max-width: 550px;
            width: 90%;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            animation: fadeInUp 0.3s ease;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);}
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0);}
        }
        .modal-header {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .modal-header h3 {
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }
        .close-modal {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: white;
        }
        .close-modal:hover {
            color: #3b82f6;
        }
        .modal-body {
            padding: 28px 28px;
        }
        .modal-body p {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #1e293b;
        }
        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .social-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .social-link i {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .social-link:hover {
            background: #3b82f6;
            color: white;
        }
        .contact-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 14px 0;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .modal-img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            max-height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        .modal-detail-list {
            margin: 16px 0 0 20px;
        }
        .quote-block {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 48px 32px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0 30px;
        }
        footer {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 48px 20px 32px;
            border-top-left-radius: 32px;
            border-top-right-radius: 32px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .btn-up {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #3b82f6;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 40px;
            padding: 10px 28px;
            margin-top: 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
            .section-title:before, .section-title:after { display: none; }
            .container { padding: 0 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>PKL DIMIGI ARAHAN &nbsp;| &nbsp;7 Persons</h1>
        <p>Infrastruktur Jaringan · Cyber Security · Sistem Keamanan Siber<br>Dokumentasi resmi perjalanan 7 orang selama masa Praktik Kerja Lapangan.</p>
        <div class="tagline"><i class="fas fa-shield-haltered"></i> from Dec '25 → Oct '26 </div>
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    <section>
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i> Identitas Anggota<i class="fas fa-network-wired"></i></h2>
            <div class="team-grid" id="teamContainer"></div>
            <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569;"><i class="fas fa-hand-pointer"></i> Klik kartu anggota untuk melihat profil & media sosial</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section style="background: #ffffff;">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-camera"></i> Dokumentasi <i class="fas fa-diagram-project"></i></h2>
            <div class="gallery" id="galleryContainer"></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section style="background: #fefefe;">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-timeline"></i>Perjalanan Waktu<i class="fas fa-mouse-pointer"></i></h2>
            <div class="months-grid" id="monthsTimeline"></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="quote-block">
            <i class="fas fa-quote-left" style="color:#3b82f6; font-size: 2rem;"></i>
            <div class="quote-text" style="font-size:1.2rem;">"Dari konfigurasi router hingga penetration testing, 7 orang belajar bahwa keamanan bukan hanya tentang firewall, tapi juga tentang trust dan kolaborasi."</div>
            <p style="margin-top: 18px; font-weight: 500;">— PKL Network & Security Division 2025</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<footer>
    <div class="footer-logo">&lt;7_PERSONS/&gt;</div>
    <p>Dokumentasi lengkap project infrastruktur jaringan & cyber security<br>Selama 10 bulan penuh dedikasi: Desember 2025 – Oktober 2026</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn-up" id="backToTop"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i> Back to Top</a>
    <div style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 0.75rem;">© 2025 7 Engineers — PKL Network & Cyber Security</div>
</footer>

<div id="globalModal" class="modal">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-header">
            <h3 id="modalTitle">Detail</h3>
            <button class="close-modal" id="closeModalBtn">&times;</button>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-body" id="modalBody"></div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    const teamMembers = [
        { 
            name: "Adistira Rizqi Ramadani", role: "Network Engineer", avatarIcon: "🌐", 
